      "text": "Every engineer who has built a distributed system has re-learned these. You built VSTS at scale — you've lived each one."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#015",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:distributed-systems:00-overview, git-history:distributed-systems:00-overview]",
